This directory stores function icon image assets used by card rendering and icon pipelines.

Reference:
- `FUNCTION_ICON_DESCRIPTIONS.md` contains the canonical icon meaning text and rule notes.

Conventions:
- Keep file names in lowercase snake_case (e.g., reminder_of_game.png).
- Use transparent-background PNG files.
- Keep one file per function icon meaning; do not duplicate aliases.
- Prefer replacing image content in-place over renaming once references exist.

UI usage:
- These assets are rendered in the Database View Special Cards `Function` column.
- Header icon toggles in that table use the same files for filtering controls.
- If icon files are added/renamed, update:
  - `public/index.html` toggle markup
  - `public/js/card-display.js` field-to-icon mapping
  - `docs/special-card-icons.md` mapping table
